---
name: qa-complete
version: 0.3.0
description: QA report for one layer; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed` and of the PR comment. Lists the finding beads filed this round.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - checked_bead
  - sprint
  - round
  - branch
  - commit
  - verdict
  - deliverables_complete
  - deliverables_total
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - findings_ceremony
  - findings_md
  - reviewers_md
  - execution_inventory
  - execution_required
optional_variables:
  - pr_number
  - carried_md
  - notes_md
defaults:
  pr_number: ""
  carried_md: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: qa-complete
  tags:
    - stage:qa
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: qa-complete
    stage: qa
    transition: complete
---
{% if verdict not in ["PASS", "FAIL"] %}{{ verdict | verdict_must_be_PASS_or_FAIL }}ERROR: verdict must be PASS or FAIL, got {{ verdict }}
{% endif %}{% if verdict == "PASS" %}{% for i in execution_inventory %}{% if execution_inventory | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", i.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", i.id) | list | length != 1 %}{{ i.id | execution_inventory_duplicate_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} is listed twice in the reviewer inventory
{% endif %}{% set m = execution_required | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", i.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", i.id) | selectattr("ref", "eq", i.ref) | list %}{% if m | length != 1 %}{{ i.id | execution_required_omitted_or_duplicate_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} needs exactly one resolution
{% else %}{% for x in m %}{% if x.status != "pass" or x.evidence_commit != commit %}{{ i.id | execution_required_unresolved_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: execution-required {{ i.id }} is not resolved at {{ commit }}
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% for r in execution_required %}{% if execution_inventory | selectattr("reviewer", "eq", r.reviewer) | selectattr("id", "eq", r.id) | selectattr("ref", "eq", r.ref) | list | length != 1 %}{{ r.id | execution_required_unmatched_blocks_PASS }}ERROR: resolution {{ r.id }} matches no reviewer execution-required entry
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}# QA {{ verdict }}: {{ checked_bead }} round {{ round }}

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
QA bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Reviewed commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: {{ ('#' ~ pr_number) if pr_number else 'none' }}
Deliverables: {{ deliverables_complete }}/{{ deliverables_total }}
Findings filed: {{ findings_blocking }} blocking, {{ findings_important }} important, {{ findings_minor }} minor; {{ findings_ceremony }} closed as ceremony

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "checked_bead": {{ checked_bead | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "round": {{ round }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "deliverables": {"complete": {{ deliverables_complete }}, "total": {{ deliverables_total }} },
  "findings": {"blocking": {{ findings_blocking }}, "important": {{ findings_important }}, "minor": {{ findings_minor }}, "ceremony": {{ findings_ceremony }} },
  "execution_inventory": {{ execution_inventory | tojson }},
  "execution_required": {{ execution_required | tojson }}
}
```

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}
{% if carried_md %}
## Carried Findings
{{ carried_md }}
{% endif %}
## Reviewers
{{ reviewers_md }}
{% if execution_required %}
## Execution-Required Items
| id | reviewer | ref | command | expected | result | evidence commit | status |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for item in execution_required %}| {{ item.id }} | {{ item.reviewer }} | {{ item.ref }} | `{{ item.command }}` | {{ item.expected }} | {{ item.result }} | `{{ item.evidence_commit }}` | {{ item.status }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
